  "title": "The artifact loader returns only the first configured directory",
  "detail": "Every caller treats the returned set as complete, so a document in any later directory is never validated. Whether an unvalidated document can reach a trusted path was not established from the evidence to hand, which is why this is anchored at 50 rather than higher.",
